{"shortDescription":"KoskiRent Plc | Stock Exchange Release | August 31, 2026 at 16:00:00 EESTThis release is a summary of KoskiRent Plc’s Half-year financial report for January–June 2026. The full release is attached and available on our website at https://modulo.fi/investors/releases/.April–June 2026 in brief· Revenu…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["KoskiRent Plc | Stock Exchange Release | August 31, 2026 at 16:00:00 EEST"]},{"type":"p","children":["This release is a summary of KoskiRent Plc’s Half-year financial report for January–June 2026. The full release is attached and available on our website at https://modulo.fi/investors/releases/."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["April–June 2026 in brief"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["· Revenue totalled EUR 4,033 (2,089) thousand, an increase of 93.1%."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Revenue growth was significantly affected by the commencement of the Vöyri project."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Adjusted EBITDA totalled EUR 1,486 (1,635) thousand, i. E. 36.8% (78.3%) of revenue."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Cash flow before change in working capital (FFO) totalled EUR 193 (373) thousand."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Loan-to-value ratio increased to 57.3% (54.6%)."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Financial expenses totalled EUR 1,306 (1,274) thousand, i. E. 32.4% (61.0%) of revenue."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Total comprehensive income was -471 (-922) thousand. The change in fair value of the module stock had an impact of -810 (-1,396) thousand during the period."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Comparability is affected by the school project sold to the municipality of Vöyri as a turnkey contract, which involves the divestment of modules previously leased in Gesterby, Kirkkonummi, as well as by sales of project management services during the reporting period, which were not included in the comparison period."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["January–June 2026 in brief"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["· Revenue totalled EUR 5,636 (4,146) thousand, an increase of 35.9%."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Adjusted EBITDA totalled EUR 2,720 (3,336) thousand, i. E. 48.3% (80.5%) of revenue."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Cash flow before change in working capital (FFO) totalled EUR 215 (825) thousand."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Loan-to-value ratio increased to 57.3% (54.6%)."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Financial expenses totalled EUR 2,529 (2,547) thousand, i. E. 44.9% (61.4%) of revenue."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Total comprehensive income was -2,887 (-2,014) thousand. The main contributing factor was the change in fair value of the module stock, which had an impact of -3,390 (-3,114) thousand during the period."]},{"type":"p","children":["· Comparability is affected by the school project sold to the municipality of Vöyri as a turnkey contract, which involves the divestment of modules previously leased in Gesterby, Kirkkonummi, as well as by sales of project management services during the reporting period, which were not included in the comparison period."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Outlook for 2026"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["KoskiRent Plc does not provide a short-term guidance."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Key figures"]}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":["EUR thousand, unless otherwise indicated"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["4-6/2026"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["4-6/2025"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["Change"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1},"children":[{"type":"b","children":["1-6/2026"]}]